---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Ceisiadau Cynllunio" title_en="Planning Applications">
  <div class="page-banner">
    <h1><span lang="cy">Cynllunio</span><span lang="en">Planning</span></h1>
  </div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Cynllunio</span><span lang="en">Planning</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content">
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Ceisiadau Cynllunio</span><span lang="en">Planning Applications</span></h2>
    <hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Mae Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan yn ymateb i geisiadau cynllunio a drafodir yng nghyfarfodydd y cyngor. Nid yw'r cyngor yn awdurdod cynllunio — Cyngor Bwrdeistref Sirol Conwy sy'n penderfynu ar geisiadau cynllunio yn yr ardal hon.</p>
    <p lang="en">Llansannan Community Council responds to planning applications discussed at council meetings. The council is not a planning authority — Conwy County Borough Council determines planning applications in this area.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Gweld Ceisiadau Cynllunio</span><span lang="en">View Planning Applications</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">I weld ceisiadau cynllunio cyfredol yn ardal Llansannan, ewch i borth cynllunio Conwy:</p>
    <p lang="en">To view current planning applications in the Llansannan area, visit Conwy's planning portal:</p>
    <p><a href="https://www.conwy.gov.uk/en/Resident/Planning-Building-Control-and-Conservation/Planning-Applications/Planning-Explorer.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">
      <span lang="cy">Chwilio a Gweld Ceisiadau Cynllunio →</span>
      <span lang="en">Search &amp; View Planning Applications →</span>
    </a></p>
    <ul style="margin:0.5rem 0 1rem 1.5rem;line-height:2">
      <li><a href="https://www.conwy.gov.uk/en/Resident/Planning-Building-Control-and-Conservation/Planning-Applications/Weekly-List-of-Planning-Applications-Registered.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span lang="cy">Rhestr wythnosol o geisiadau cynllunio a gofrestrwyd</span><span lang="en">Weekly list of planning applications registered</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.conwy.gov.uk/en/Resident/Planning-Building-Control-and-Conservation/Planning-Applications/Comment-on-a-Planning-Application.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span lang="cy">Gwneud sylw ar gais cynllunio cyfredol</span><span lang="en">Comment on a current planning application</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.conwy.gov.uk/en/Resident/Planning-Building-Control-and-Conservation/Planning-Applications/Planning.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span lang="cy">Tudalen gynllunio Cyngor Conwy</span><span lang="en">Conwy County Borough Council planning page</span></a></li>
    </ul>
    <p style="font-size:0.85rem"><span lang="cy">Mae'r dolenni'n agor gwefan Cyngor Conwy, sydd â'i dewis iaith ei hun.</span><span lang="en">These links open Conwy County Borough Council's website.</span></p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Ymateb y Cyngor</span><span lang="en">Council Responses</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Trafodir ceisiadau cynllunio yng nghyfarfodydd rheolaidd y cyngor. Gellir gweld ymatebion y cyngor yng nghofnodion y cyfarfodydd perthnasol.</p>
    <p lang="en">Planning applications are discussed at the council's regular meetings. The council's responses can be found in the minutes of the relevant meetings.</p>
    <p><a href="/meetings/minutes/">
      <span lang="cy">Gweld Cofnodion →</span>
      <span lang="en">View Minutes →</span>
    </a></p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
